<title>POLAND: Universal Q4 net rises to PLN 7.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Universal Q4 net rises to PLN 7.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     12.36  vs   1.26</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 10.26  vs   6.66</p>
<p>    net profit				7.61  vs   4.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is PHZ Universal SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				20.54  vs  28.26</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 50.96  vs  47.86</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.04  vs   0.12</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				3.19  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    tax refund				0.54  vs   1.46 other tax</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   29.07  vs  21.18</p>
<p>    financial costs			31.13  vs  15.67</p>
<p>    investment			     35.25  vs  18.08</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     19.27  vs   1.34 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 30.12  vs  14.06</p>
<p>    net profit			     23.03  vs  12.00</p>
<p>    net sales			     107.86  vs 112.01</p>
<p>    costs of sales			115.21  vs 117.54</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.51  vs   1.07</p>
<p>@ income tax				  3.19  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    other taxes			     3.91  vs   1.46</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   116.17 vs  82.28</p>
<p>    financial costs			104.81 vs  65.82</p>
<p>    investment				37.11 vs  22.06</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
